1
00:00:00,494 --> 00:00:02,424
(Howard:)Sorry, just
passing through.

2
00:00:02,429 --> 00:00:04,599
(Howard:)I think this fell off your cart.

3
00:00:07,267 --> 00:00:08,867
(Raj:)Come on. What do you say?

4
00:00:08,869 --> 00:00:10,499
(Raj:)Let me make it up to you.

5
00:00:10,504 --> 00:00:12,804
(Isabella:)You're very persistent.

6
00:00:12,806 --> 00:00:15,306
(Raj:)It's my one move.

7
00:00:15,309 --> 00:00:17,379
(Amy:)Okay.

8
00:00:18,345 --> 00:00:20,175
(Isabella:)This Sunday night,
you may take me to dinner

9
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,450
(Isabella:)at a nice restaurant.

10
00:00:21,448 --> 00:00:23,948
(Penny:)Great.
Where would you like to go?

11
00:00:23,951 --> 00:00:25,151
(Isabella:)Your choice.

12
00:00:25,152 --> 00:00:27,522
(Isabella:)It can be Pakistani food,
if you like.

13
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:29,151
(Raj:)Excuse me, but I'm Indian.

14
00:00:29,156 --> 00:00:31,326
(Isabella:)And now you know how it feels.

15
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:44,219
(Penny:)So, were you turned
on even a little bit?

16
00:00:44,218 --> 00:00:45,288
(Amy:)It was like

17
00:00:45,286 --> 00:00:48,656
(Amy:)being hit on
by Rat Pack Pee-wee Herman.

18
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:52,325
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, is that a yes?

19
00:00:52,326 --> 00:00:54,356
No!

20
00:00:54,362 --> 00:00:55,962
(Scene:)Amy,

21
00:00:55,963 --> 00:00:58,493
(Sheldon:)I didn't want it
to come to this.

